# Expected Radar Logs

Moving target:

```text
Radar: state=MOVING detection=342 cm moving=360 cm/24 stationary=353 cm/19
PRESENT
```

Stationary target:

```text
Radar: state=STATIONARY detection=343 cm moving=366 cm/0 stationary=366 cm/49
```

Moving and stationary target information:

```text
Radar: state=MOVING_AND_STATIONARY detection=91 cm moving=76 cm/100 stationary=75 cm/100
```

No target:

```text
Radar: state=NONE detection=343 cm moving=366 cm/0 stationary=366 cm/17
NOT_PRESENT
```

---

# Expected UDP Log

If presence occurs before DHCP completes:

```text
PRESENT
UDP send postponed: Wi-Fi not connected yet
```

The firmware retains the pending event.

After the IP address is obtained:

```text
Network ready           : YES
UDP presence_event sent: {"type":"presence_event","state":"PRESENT","distance_mm":470,"source":"presence_node_v1"}
```

On a later transition:

```text
NOT_PRESENT
PRESENT
UDP presence_event sent: {"type":"presence_event","state":"PRESENT","distance_mm":3430,"source":"presence_node_v1"}
```

